WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.995
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.265 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.065 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.145 --> 01:45.265
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

5
01:45.345 --> 01:48.185
LONGEVITY

6
01:49.985 --> 01:52.305
‎-That's amazing. ‎-Right.

7
01:52.385 --> 01:53.425
Come.

8
01:58.185 --> 01:59.705
-Cheers. -Cheers.

9
02:00.705 --> 02:01.625
Come.

10
02:01.705 --> 02:03.025
-Try this. -It's delicious.

11
02:14.945 --> 02:16.265
Wonderful.

12
02:21.305 --> 02:24.705
Lady Xie, what do you think is the thickest thing in the world?

13
02:25.865 --> 02:27.985
I'd say some people's skin.

14
02:28.865 --> 02:30.945
No blade can cut it, no arrow can pierce it.

15
02:31.025 --> 02:33.865
How else could they commit so many vile deeds

16
02:33.945 --> 02:34.985
and still smile as if nothing happened,

17
02:35.825 --> 02:37.385
without a shred of shame?

18
02:38.385 --> 02:40.665
Lady Xie said she was too ill to come.

19
02:41.265 --> 02:44.025
But you asked her several times, and insisted her to attend.

20
02:45.465 --> 02:46.945
So that's Xie Hualou.

21
02:47.745 --> 02:49.625
She looks much thinner than before.

22
02:50.225 --> 02:51.585
Are you feeling better now?

23
02:51.665 --> 02:54.865
Don't you know what made Lady Xie ill?

24
02:54.945 --> 02:57.585
She had the misfortune of crossing a vicious, treacherous woman

25
02:58.265 --> 03:00.025
who nearly cost her life.

26
03:00.105 --> 03:03.185
From what she's saying, could it be her cousin-in-law?

27
03:03.265 --> 03:04.785
Don't go accusing people blindly.

28
03:04.865 --> 03:07.585
Attempted murder is punishable by hanging.

29
03:08.345 --> 03:11.105
Hualou, you mustn't let a moment of mercy

30
03:11.185 --> 03:13.105
allow evil to fester and bring more harm.

31
03:16.225 --> 03:18.985
It is still the seventh month, and the heat hasn't let up.

32
03:19.065 --> 03:21.545
I'm afraid the young ladies can't bear it.

33
03:22.385 --> 03:24.425
They've seen this entertainment many times.

34
03:25.345 --> 03:27.865
Why not let them take a walk

35
03:28.385 --> 03:30.465
and enjoy the grounds of the Duke's Residence?

36
03:31.385 --> 03:34.985
Heat? I'd say someone's hiding a guilty conscience.

37
03:35.705 --> 03:37.785
Her plot failed, and now she's ashamed.

38
03:38.705 --> 03:42.585
Old Madam Xie, why would you say that?

39
03:42.665 --> 03:44.025
Our Xie family

40
03:44.105 --> 03:46.185
has done everything to protect the Duke's reputation.

41
03:47.265 --> 03:49.545
We have no wish to shatter the jade vase in pursuit of a rat.

42
03:49.625 --> 03:52.385
Otherwise, I'd have gone straight to the Wei family

43
03:52.465 --> 03:53.505
and demanded justice.

44
03:54.265 --> 03:56.585
So why keep pretending you know nothing?

45
03:59.745 --> 04:02.185
Brother. What exactly is going on?

46
04:02.785 --> 04:04.905
From what I can see, something seems a little off.

47
04:21.105 --> 04:21.944
Bring it in.

48
04:27.865 --> 04:29.505
-What's going on? -What is it?

49
04:29.585 --> 04:30.505
Here comes a cool breeze.

50
04:31.665 --> 04:33.825
I've never seen anything like this before.

51
04:34.985 --> 04:36.185
Interesting.

52
04:36.785 --> 04:38.545
LONGEVITY

53
04:42.505 --> 04:43.905
It really does fill the hall with a breeze.

54
04:43.985 --> 04:45.265
It's so cool, my arms are getting chilly.

55
04:45.345 --> 04:46.705
Brother, you're brilliant.

56
04:46.785 --> 04:48.025
With this wind wheel,

57
04:48.105 --> 04:51.145
the room is filled with refreshing lotus fragrance.

58
04:51.225 --> 04:52.345
What a clever contraption.

59
04:52.945 --> 04:54.865
Brother, you've kept this well hidden. Only showing it to us now?

60
04:55.625 --> 04:57.345
This summer has been unbearably hot.

61
04:57.945 --> 04:59.705
And the ladies are all dressed formally for the banquet.

62
05:00.305 --> 05:02.345
Rao feared the ladies may fall victim to heatstroke

63
05:02.985 --> 05:04.665
so she had the finest craftsmen make it.

64
05:05.385 --> 05:07.585
The palace craftsmen have made seven-bladed fans before.

65
05:07.665 --> 05:09.745
-But… -It really is impressive.

66
05:09.825 --> 05:10.665
She is very thoughtful,

67
05:11.625 --> 05:13.225
always attentive to the smallest details.

68
05:15.705 --> 05:18.145
How unusual. Brother is always so stern.

69
05:19.145 --> 05:21.105
When have we ever heard him praise anyone?

70
05:21.185 --> 05:24.185
It seems he's quite pleased with his new wife.

71
05:28.105 --> 05:31.385
This spinning-wheel-style wind wheel was inspired by a farm winnowing fan.

72
05:31.465 --> 05:34.345
Farmers use its airflow to blow away the chaff,

73
05:34.425 --> 05:35.585
making it much easier to winnow grain.

74
05:35.665 --> 05:38.745
Qingtong told me

75
05:38.825 --> 05:40.145
Grandmother has been unwell in the heat,

76
05:40.225 --> 05:42.665
listless and weary with no appetite.

77
05:43.625 --> 05:46.425
So I asked My Lord to have someone make this.

78
05:46.985 --> 05:48.945
Thankfully, it was ready for the birthday banquet,

79
05:49.025 --> 05:52.305
so our guests won't have to suffer in the heat.

80
05:52.385 --> 05:56.345
I've seen a fan like this at a farm's threshing ground.

81
05:56.425 --> 05:59.625
I never knew it could be used this way.

82
05:59.705 --> 06:04.105
I wonder how all seven blades are linked together.

83
06:05.945 --> 06:07.425
What a good girl.

84
06:07.945 --> 06:11.305
Lu Zhuo, you've married such a devoted and virtuous wife.

85
06:12.145 --> 06:15.025
You must have earned this blessing in a past life.

86
06:15.825 --> 06:18.745
My dear, I must thank you as well.

87
06:18.825 --> 06:21.305
When the Lu family was in dire straits,

88
06:21.385 --> 06:23.145
you entrusted this blessed girl to our family.

89
06:24.225 --> 06:26.425
She is not only Lu Zhuo's lifesaver,

90
06:26.505 --> 06:29.305
also a blessing to our entire family.

91
06:29.905 --> 06:31.905
You're too kind, Old Madam Lu.

92
06:31.985 --> 06:34.505
She's still young. Such praise

93
06:35.345 --> 06:37.705
might bring her more fortune than she can bear.

94
06:38.225 --> 06:41.665
How many people ever get a second chance at life?

95
06:41.745 --> 06:44.665
Lord Lu owes it all to marrying such a blessed wife.

96
06:45.705 --> 06:46.745
Indeed.

97
06:50.225 --> 06:52.745
My Lady, the Xie family may attend the banquet too.

98
06:53.545 --> 06:54.585
I'm worried…

99
06:54.665 --> 06:55.505
THE XIE AND HAN FAMILIES ARE SWORN ENEMIES

100
06:56.105 --> 06:57.465
There's no avoiding them.

101
06:58.305 --> 07:01.705
I'll bear the consequences of Wei Rao's mistakes.

102
07:01.785 --> 07:03.945
But as long as Lord Lu

103
07:04.825 --> 07:06.985
cares about the Duke's reputation

104
07:08.105 --> 07:10.385
and wishes his grandmother to enjoy the birthday banquet,

105
07:11.185 --> 07:12.105
he

106
07:13.905 --> 07:16.025
will be my strongest shield.

107
07:20.785 --> 07:21.625
Move them to both sides.

108
07:23.225 --> 07:24.265
Come.

109
07:44.825 --> 07:46.585
On the Duchess's birthday banquet,

110
07:46.665 --> 07:49.185
even the slightest slip will be the talk of the town.

111
07:49.265 --> 07:50.545
Rest assured, Madam.

112
07:50.625 --> 07:53.665
That whole box of butterflies has been smothered to death.

113
07:53.745 --> 07:56.625
She'll disgrace herself before everyone at the banquet.

114
08:01.505 --> 08:02.905
Mother,

115
08:03.425 --> 08:06.945
I heard your granddaughter-in-law won't follow tradition this year.

116
08:07.025 --> 08:09.945
She plans to release butterflies for your birthday.

117
08:10.025 --> 08:12.785
Look, she even brought in a lotus vat.

118
08:13.505 --> 08:15.825
Soon, at this banquet,

119
08:15.905 --> 08:18.985
lights blazing, lotuses blooming,

120
08:19.065 --> 08:20.465
butterflies fluttering everywhere.

121
08:21.225 --> 08:24.225
Truly an ingenious and delightful idea.

122
08:24.825 --> 08:27.505
Butterflies? Open it! Hurry!

123
08:28.105 --> 08:30.945
The air holes in that bamboo box look far too small.

124
08:31.025 --> 08:32.305
On such an auspicious day,

125
08:32.385 --> 08:34.664
we mustn't let any living creature suffocate.

126
08:34.745 --> 08:37.225
Quick. Let them out at once.

127
08:37.305 --> 08:38.585
Hurry, let them out.

128
08:39.705 --> 08:42.505
Grandmother, if I may, please open it yourself.

129
09:13.185 --> 09:14.745
The butterflies really suffocated?

130
09:15.505 --> 09:18.065
A joyous day has turned into needless killing.

131
09:18.145 --> 09:20.705
It'll cost blessings and longevity. How awful!

132
09:20.785 --> 09:21.865
Exactly.

133
09:21.945 --> 09:23.905
They all suffocated in the box.

134
09:24.665 --> 09:26.065
That's a terrible omen.

135
09:26.665 --> 09:28.185
She should've just followed tradition.

136
09:28.785 --> 09:30.185
But no, she had to do something different.

137
09:30.785 --> 09:33.105
And look at the bad luck it's brought.

138
09:33.905 --> 09:36.185
The Duchess despises the killing of living creatures.

139
09:36.265 --> 09:37.385
She'll be furious.

140
09:47.025 --> 09:49.545
This is… a fire lighter?

141
09:58.545 --> 09:59.385
Bring it in.

142
10:42.465 --> 10:44.625
Those… Those aren't butterflies!

143
10:45.225 --> 10:47.065
Then why were you catching butterflies?

144
10:47.665 --> 10:50.825
Third Aunt, living creatures are meant to be free.

145
10:50.905 --> 10:51.825
Why catch them just to release them?

146
10:52.465 --> 10:53.385
Besides, butterflies may be beautiful,

147
10:53.465 --> 10:54.905
but the powder on their wings can be harmful.

148
10:54.985 --> 10:57.745
Butterflies left the dew-gathering maids with red and swollen eyes.

149
10:57.825 --> 10:59.225
I merely had them driven away.

150
11:00.585 --> 11:02.545
She refused to have it brought in openly.

151
11:02.625 --> 11:05.665
she meant for everyone to guess what's in the box.

152
11:06.545 --> 11:07.945
Cheeky move, I'll say that.

153
11:12.425 --> 11:13.505
Grandmother.

154
11:14.025 --> 11:15.945
This lamp is called Everfull.

155
11:16.705 --> 11:19.785
Everfull means may your years be ever full.

156
11:19.865 --> 11:24.545
May you live a long, healthy, peaceful life.

157
11:25.465 --> 11:28.145
You're awfully young to make such a grand promise.

158
11:28.225 --> 11:30.505
How can a mere lamp promise peace?

159
11:31.265 --> 11:33.465
There were meant to be 108 lamps,

160
11:34.065 --> 11:35.905
corresponding to 108 worries.

161
11:35.985 --> 11:38.105
Once they're burned away, Grandmother will be worry-free.

162
11:41.345 --> 11:43.585
And this one has…

163
11:43.665 --> 11:45.145
60 lamps?

164
11:45.225 --> 11:48.265
Yes. Grandmother shall light it yourself.

165
11:48.785 --> 11:51.865
For each year you gain, let one more lamp be added.

166
11:52.385 --> 11:55.025
One year after another, until there are 108 lamps.

167
11:55.105 --> 11:57.265
That would be true and endless blessings.

168
11:59.945 --> 12:01.665
You sweet-talking child.

169
12:02.345 --> 12:05.425
Do you expect me to live past 100?

170
12:05.505 --> 12:06.785
I'd be an old fossil by then!

171
12:07.665 --> 12:10.625
-She's joking. -So it's a centennial lamp.

172
12:10.705 --> 12:12.785
What an auspicious sign.

173
12:12.865 --> 12:14.225
Far more than 100 years.

174
12:14.305 --> 12:17.425
Since ancient times, 108 has meant perfect fulfillment.

175
12:17.505 --> 12:19.945
It's called 108, but it wishes for a boundless longevity.

176
12:20.025 --> 12:21.745
What a thoughtful idea.

177
12:22.705 --> 12:25.705
Every wick on this lamp was made by Wei Rao from lamp paper

178
12:25.785 --> 12:27.345
and twisted by hand.

179
12:27.425 --> 12:29.065
It shows her heartfelt devotion.

180
12:32.025 --> 12:35.945
Mother was kind enough to spare me from most of the household affairs,

181
12:36.025 --> 12:39.265
so I had time to personally prepare this gift for Grandmother.

182
12:39.345 --> 12:40.745
Good.

183
12:43.825 --> 12:44.665
It's the least I can do.

184
12:59.465 --> 13:00.665
Grandmother, please light the lamp.

185
13:01.385 --> 13:02.225
All right.

186
13:42.345 --> 13:45.545
-It's beautiful. -It is.

187
13:54.185 --> 13:56.625
My Lord. General Qi and the Han family are fighting.

188
14:05.625 --> 14:06.465
Look.

189
14:07.065 --> 14:09.665
Han Liao, today is a joyous day for the Duke's family.

190
14:09.745 --> 14:10.945
Making trouble again?

191
14:11.025 --> 14:12.065
Get out of my way!

192
14:12.145 --> 14:13.825
You have a death wish?

193
14:14.345 --> 14:15.185
Stop.

194
14:18.745 --> 14:20.585
Lord Lu, forgive the disturbance.

195
14:21.105 --> 14:24.145
Zhuo, I had barely arrived when he came looking for trouble.

196
14:24.225 --> 14:26.745
I came to deliver a birthday gift on behalf of my mother,

197
14:27.345 --> 14:29.305
and got attacked the moment I arrived.

198
14:29.945 --> 14:32.185
Everyone here saw it.

199
14:32.265 --> 14:35.385
General Qi attacked me without asking.

200
14:36.745 --> 14:37.825
Lord Lu,

201
14:38.985 --> 14:40.825
is this how the Lu family treats its guests?

202
14:42.065 --> 14:43.505
So what if I attack?

203
14:43.585 --> 14:45.905
Back when we marched on Hutuo, you were supposed to back us up.

204
14:45.985 --> 14:48.385
When things got bad, you delayed and refused to dispatch troops

205
14:48.465 --> 14:49.305
almost cost us the war.

206
14:50.065 --> 14:52.105
-You deserved every blow! -Enough!

207
14:54.705 --> 14:57.265
A guest is a guest once they're through the door. For my sake,

208
14:57.905 --> 15:00.585
No fighting tonight. Don't make a scene.

209
15:00.665 --> 15:04.665
Out of respect for Lord Lu, I'll let this brute off.

210
15:09.905 --> 15:11.465
The Duke sent word.

211
15:11.545 --> 15:13.625
He wants you in the front courtyard to receive guests.

212
15:14.265 --> 15:15.865
The Marquis of Pingxi heard General Qi had arrived

213
15:16.465 --> 15:17.985
and wants you there to help with the drinking.

214
15:18.625 --> 15:20.025
Lady Rao came dressed for the occasion…

215
15:20.105 --> 15:21.265
-I… -I'll go now.

216
15:24.545 --> 15:25.425
Lord Han.

217
15:31.585 --> 15:33.985
My mother acquired a precious mirror from the Western Regions.

218
15:34.065 --> 15:37.145
She insisted I present it to the Duchess myself.

219
15:40.545 --> 15:43.025
I'll first pay my respects to the birthday lady,

220
15:43.105 --> 15:44.265
present the gift, and toast.

221
15:44.945 --> 15:46.345
Then I'll join you at the banquet.

222
15:46.425 --> 15:48.865
Please apologize to the Duke for me.

223
15:48.945 --> 15:50.265
Tell him I'll be there shortly.

224
15:51.665 --> 15:53.025
Rest assured, Lord Lu.

225
15:54.065 --> 15:55.465
I was also born into a noble family.

226
15:55.545 --> 15:57.585
My conduct reflects my family's honor.

227
15:57.665 --> 16:00.985
Causing trouble at a birthday banquet would only make me a laughingstock.

228
16:01.505 --> 16:05.265
At least I know how to behave, unlike some people.

229
16:08.225 --> 16:09.625
I'll show our guest the way.

230
16:09.705 --> 16:11.825
Lord Han, please.

231
16:22.145 --> 16:24.105
-Thank you. This way. -All right.

232
16:24.185 --> 16:26.225
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

233
16:26.305 --> 16:27.145
Lord Huo.

234
16:30.505 --> 16:31.945
Please inform Her Ladyship

235
16:32.025 --> 16:35.425
that Huo Jue, on Lady Shou'an's orders, has brought a Nuo opera troupe

236
16:35.505 --> 16:37.545
to celebrate the Duchess's birthday.

237
16:38.145 --> 16:39.985
Lord Huo, please have some tea in the hall.

238
16:40.065 --> 16:41.145
I'll report your arrival at once.

239
16:43.145 --> 16:45.065
-Let's go. -This way.

240
16:52.425 --> 16:53.665
Your Ladyship, a moment.

241
16:56.105 --> 16:58.585
I hear Lord Lu's old wound still hasn't healed.

242
16:59.585 --> 17:01.705
My family has a healer

243
17:01.785 --> 17:03.305
who's highly skilled at treating wounds.

244
17:03.385 --> 17:06.345
Her family's Dragon Bone Wound Powder is unmatched.

245
17:07.704 --> 17:08.545
Madam Liu.

246
17:08.625 --> 17:09.665
Yes!

247
17:21.505 --> 17:24.424
Madam Liu, pay your respects to Her Ladyship.

248
17:25.305 --> 17:28.505
Greetings, Lady… Lady Lu.

249
17:36.865 --> 17:39.905
What is it? Do you know this woman?

250
17:51.785 --> 17:53.785
Lord Lu was wounded fighting for the realm.

251
17:54.465 --> 17:56.865
His Majesty has asked about his recovery many times.

252
17:56.945 --> 17:59.465
Therefore, Lord Lu's health

253
17:59.545 --> 18:01.665
has always been overseen by imperial physicians.

254
18:02.265 --> 18:06.305
Only senior physicians skilled in medicine, acupuncture, and surgery

255
18:06.385 --> 18:09.345
with 20 years of practice are permitted to come here.

256
18:09.985 --> 18:11.065
Lord Han, may I ask

257
18:11.665 --> 18:13.865
where did you find this quack?

258
18:13.945 --> 18:16.345
And you dare bring her here so brazenly?

259
18:16.425 --> 18:17.625
What?

260
18:18.705 --> 18:21.585
Do you think so little of His Majesty's imperial physicians?

261
18:22.265 --> 18:24.065
Or do you look down on the Lu family?

262
18:27.385 --> 18:29.745
Or are you plotting to harm Lord Lu?

263
18:33.505 --> 18:35.985
You insolent old woman! How dare you stare at the noble lady?

264
18:36.905 --> 18:39.345
Forgive me! I wouldn't dare.

265
18:39.425 --> 18:41.825
Didn't you say Her Ladyship looked like someone you once knew?

266
18:42.985 --> 18:44.705
Look up and take a good look.

267
18:55.385 --> 18:58.305
Her figure does look somewhat similar.

268
19:03.465 --> 19:06.465
But the young woman I knew

269
19:06.545 --> 19:08.545
was just a night-soil woman.

270
19:09.705 --> 19:12.225
She was filthy, with matted hair and a dirty face,

271
19:12.305 --> 19:14.145
and wouldn't wash her face for months.

272
19:14.225 --> 19:18.625
No one even knew what she really looked like.

273
19:18.705 --> 19:22.865
Compared to this elegant young lady,

274
19:22.945 --> 19:26.465
she was a firefly beside the moon,

275
19:26.545 --> 19:28.265
a crow beside a phoenix.

276
19:28.345 --> 19:29.785
How could they possibly compare?

277
19:30.665 --> 19:32.785
That's not what you told me before!

278
19:34.545 --> 19:35.585
A what?

279
19:38.385 --> 19:39.825
Lord Han, what did you compare me to?

280
19:39.905 --> 19:44.145
My Lady, she said a night-soil woman.

281
19:45.985 --> 19:47.225
You… How dare you!

282
19:48.585 --> 19:50.305
How dare you compare me to a night-soil woman!

283
19:51.145 --> 19:51.985
There must be some misunderstanding.

284
19:55.105 --> 19:56.425
Guards, see them out!

285
19:57.065 --> 19:58.465
You filthy vermin!

286
19:58.545 --> 20:00.825
Your vile nonsense has deeply insulted me.

287
20:01.345 --> 20:03.225
If my maternal grandmother were here,

288
20:03.745 --> 20:05.145
she'd have torn your mouth apart by now!

289
20:05.985 --> 20:08.585
Bitao, throw this old beggar out!

290
20:08.665 --> 20:09.785
Yes.

291
20:10.345 --> 20:12.625
Someone, have Lu Zhuo come here!

292
20:12.705 --> 20:13.945
-Lord Han! -He brought this vile guest here.

293
20:14.025 --> 20:14.865
-Lord Han! -He can deal with her himself.

294
20:14.945 --> 20:17.985
-I only did what you told me! -You wretched thing.

295
20:18.065 --> 20:19.705
-Lord Han! -Lady Wei Rao!

296
20:20.225 --> 20:21.105
Lord Han!

297
20:23.705 --> 20:25.905
Even her wit and temper have style.

298
20:26.665 --> 20:28.625
What a shame she's married to that prude Lu Zhuo.

299
20:28.705 --> 20:30.985
Such a pity.

300
20:32.425 --> 20:34.185
Lord Han, I'll show you the way.

301
20:35.425 --> 20:38.425
There are many ladies in the garden. We mustn't disturb them.

302
20:39.785 --> 20:41.225
Wait here.

303
20:41.305 --> 20:42.785
There's no need to follow.

304
20:46.025 --> 20:47.825
What are you doing? I…

305
20:50.185 --> 20:52.825
This is outrageous!

306
20:52.905 --> 20:54.305
The mighty Duke's Residence

307
20:54.385 --> 20:58.305
is bullying a helpless old widow like me!

308
20:59.385 --> 21:01.985
You're hurting me!

309
21:02.505 --> 21:04.265
My lady has a kind heart.

310
21:04.345 --> 21:06.985
She knows you're a fraud with bad intentions,

311
21:07.065 --> 21:10.145
but she won't tarnish the Lu family's reputation for charity.

312
21:10.225 --> 21:11.065
Here.

313
21:11.145 --> 21:13.985
A bag of millet so you won't go hungry. And no more swindling people.

314
21:15.225 --> 21:16.225
Behave yourself.

315
21:30.665 --> 21:31.585
My Lady.

316
21:32.425 --> 21:33.665
Is everything delivered?

317
21:34.185 --> 21:35.425
Yes.

318
21:36.225 --> 21:37.985
Madam doesn't want to see that unwelcome guest.

319
21:38.065 --> 21:39.185
Go tell Dowager Lady

320
21:39.785 --> 21:42.985
-that my Lady went back to change. -Yes.

321
21:47.985 --> 21:49.465
Thank goodness she saw it.

322
21:52.265 --> 21:53.545
Thank goodness she understood.

323
21:54.585 --> 21:56.425
Seeing the begonia hairpin means seeing me.

324
21:56.505 --> 21:58.025
Madam Liu, please help me.

325
21:59.065 --> 22:01.625
I'll repay you generously for today's favor.

326
22:07.825 --> 22:09.145
It's mine! Don't take it!

327
22:13.505 --> 22:15.065
Give it to me! Let go!

328
22:28.425 --> 22:29.585
Good girl.

329
22:29.665 --> 22:32.545
Looks like I didn't teach you in vain.

330
22:33.065 --> 22:36.785
"If you make it big, don't forget me" was your very first lesson.

331
22:37.465 --> 22:39.385
When Madam Liu was 14,

332
22:39.465 --> 22:41.825
a wicked neighbor sold her to a brothel.

333
22:42.425 --> 22:43.625
Her working name was Begonia.

334
22:45.025 --> 22:47.425
Proud of her beauty, she thought highly of herself.

335
22:48.265 --> 22:50.305
Even there, she always had to outdo the others.

336
22:50.905 --> 22:53.425
She took every client she could to please the madam,

337
22:55.105 --> 22:57.985
all for fine clothes, good food, and a life of pleasure.

338
22:58.585 --> 23:00.985
Until her beauty faded and she fell gravely ill.

339
23:02.465 --> 23:04.385
The madam turned on her and tried to bury her alive.

340
23:04.465 --> 23:05.745
Only then did she finally wake up.

341
23:06.825 --> 23:09.145
She taught me my first song.

342
23:09.665 --> 23:12.065
She taught me to hide my face beneath grime

343
23:12.785 --> 23:14.865
and patiently wait for my chance to escape.

344
23:16.745 --> 23:19.945
You see, the people who taught me

345
23:21.425 --> 23:23.145
were either lowly courtesans,

346
23:24.225 --> 23:25.945
down-and-out scholars,

347
23:27.105 --> 23:29.305
some family's despised concubine,

348
23:29.865 --> 23:32.305
or wastrels who'd squandered their fortunes.

349
23:33.025 --> 23:36.025
They never fought each other over petty gains.

350
23:37.025 --> 23:38.265
And yet, they were also the ones

351
23:40.145 --> 23:42.705
who taught me so many valuable things.

352
23:43.665 --> 23:45.105
Like what?

353
23:45.705 --> 23:49.545
Lessons they only learned after being beaten down by this world.

354
23:50.305 --> 23:51.625
You need nerve

355
23:53.065 --> 23:54.505
before you can claim you're right.

356
23:58.665 --> 23:59.625
My Lady.

357
24:00.145 --> 24:01.345
I'm fine.

358
24:02.065 --> 24:04.305
I could barely eat at the banquet,

359
24:04.945 --> 24:06.465
and then I had to face Han Liao.

360
24:07.465 --> 24:08.745
My chest hurts a little.

361
24:09.825 --> 24:13.545
It's stomach pain. You've been so busy lately,

362
24:13.625 --> 24:16.185
always on edge and worrying too much.

363
24:17.145 --> 24:18.505
Let me help you back to rest.

364
24:20.505 --> 24:21.705
Your Ladyship.

365
24:23.665 --> 24:24.585
Your Ladyship.

366
24:25.105 --> 24:26.865
Lady Shou'an sent the Huo family's eldest son

367
24:26.945 --> 24:28.305
to wish Old Madam a happy birthday.

368
24:28.825 --> 24:32.585
He even brought a Nuo opera troupe. He's waiting in Jiangyun Hall.

369
24:35.745 --> 24:37.425
Understood. You may go.

370
24:38.225 --> 24:39.105
Yes.

371
24:49.065 --> 24:50.985
I got past Xie Hualou.

372
24:53.105 --> 24:55.105
I got past Han Liao too.

373
24:57.985 --> 24:59.505
As for Huo Jue…

374
25:01.465 --> 25:03.785
I'll get past him too.

375
25:04.385 --> 25:06.785
Lord Huo is Lady Rao's cousin.

376
25:07.425 --> 25:09.545
He knows her temperament and habits very well.

377
25:10.145 --> 25:13.225
I can find a way to send him away. Shall we?

378
25:20.585 --> 25:22.265
He's here for me.

379
25:25.585 --> 25:27.185
JIANGYUN HALL

380
25:32.985 --> 25:35.785
We won't need any of you here. You may all leave.

381
25:35.865 --> 25:37.505
JIANGYUN HALL

382
25:59.185 --> 26:02.705
GALAXY OF VERSES

383
26:05.265 --> 26:06.105
Rao.

384
26:06.985 --> 26:08.105
Brother Jue.

385
26:08.825 --> 26:09.905
It's been a long time.

386
26:16.945 --> 26:18.785
You do look somewhat like her.

387
26:19.465 --> 26:21.145
But your nature and manner differ greatly.

388
26:22.265 --> 26:23.505
The moment you spoke,

389
26:23.585 --> 26:25.705
I knew you weren't her.

390
26:27.785 --> 26:28.745
Bitao.

391
26:29.745 --> 26:32.385
My cousin brought a Nuo opera troupe for the birthday celebration.

392
26:34.025 --> 26:36.785
Go check if everything is properly arranged.

393
26:38.225 --> 26:39.065
Yes.

394
26:48.105 --> 26:50.385
Know how I saw through you at first glance?

395
26:51.145 --> 26:52.945
My little cousin

396
26:53.025 --> 26:54.985
was the proudest lady in the world.

397
26:55.585 --> 26:56.905
Ever since we were children,

398
26:57.425 --> 26:58.945
unless she needed a favor,

399
26:59.705 --> 27:02.985
whenever she saw me, she'd call me by name.

400
27:03.065 --> 27:04.865
She'd never sweetly call me "Brother Jue."

401
27:05.985 --> 27:08.105
After all, everyone doted on her.

402
27:08.185 --> 27:10.185
She had every reason to look down on the world.

403
27:14.865 --> 27:16.105
But you?

404
27:16.785 --> 27:19.105
A woman of the lowest birth,

405
27:19.865 --> 27:23.705
someone even ordinary people would go out of their way to avoid.

406
27:25.505 --> 27:27.105
You aren't even fit to hold her stirrup,

407
27:28.025 --> 27:29.625
much less take her place.

408
27:30.305 --> 27:33.785
You're just a cheap imitation, making a fool of yourself.

409
27:34.665 --> 27:36.265
The estate is packed with guests right now.

410
27:36.345 --> 27:37.465
Everyone is watching.

411
27:38.665 --> 27:39.705
So here's some friendly advice.

412
27:39.785 --> 27:42.705
Admit the truth before I expose you.

413
27:43.705 --> 27:45.545
Give back everything that isn't yours.

414
27:45.625 --> 27:49.265
Maybe I'll let you live.

415
27:53.345 --> 27:55.465
Who decides my life to be worthless?

416
27:56.505 --> 28:00.305
Who decides the fates to be rich or poor,

417
28:01.025 --> 28:03.225
the lives to be insignificant or noble?

418
28:04.465 --> 28:06.185
What gives anyone the right to decide?

419
28:09.185 --> 28:11.985
Virtue? Yet in this world,

420
28:12.065 --> 28:15.985
some people are rotten to the core and still live in luxury.

421
28:16.065 --> 28:19.105
Some commit every evil imaginable and are still made generals and lords!

422
28:19.945 --> 28:23.025
Heaven is blind. Heaven is unjust!

423
28:24.465 --> 28:27.705
It cast me into the mud from birth

424
28:27.785 --> 28:30.425
and expects me to rot there forever.

425
28:32.905 --> 28:33.825
No.

426
28:35.065 --> 28:36.745
Even if it's Heaven itself,

427
28:39.545 --> 28:41.225
it has no right.

428
28:41.825 --> 28:43.225
No one can beat fate!

429
28:43.745 --> 28:46.865
You were born lowly. How dare you covet what was never yours?

430
28:46.945 --> 28:49.825
If Heaven wants me in the mud, then I'll defy Heaven itself!

431
28:50.985 --> 28:52.905
I'll either win or die.

432
28:53.705 --> 28:55.505
I'm not even afraid of Heaven.

433
28:57.745 --> 28:58.945
You think I'm afraid of you?

434
28:59.545 --> 29:01.425
Don't keep fooling yourself.

435
29:01.505 --> 29:04.905
Leave the Lu family with me now. Give back everything you've taken.

436
29:04.985 --> 29:06.865
I ensure you a life of wealth and peace.

437
29:08.025 --> 29:08.865
You're…

438
29:11.305 --> 29:12.145
Lying.

439
29:14.705 --> 29:16.745
Back when I crawled on the ground,

440
29:17.905 --> 29:20.505
countless noblemen's boots trampled my hands.

441
29:21.425 --> 29:23.145
That's when I learned

442
29:23.785 --> 29:26.185
That look you get when you're lying.

443
29:26.265 --> 29:30.025
I saw through your lofty, hypocritical, scheming faces.

444
29:30.705 --> 29:33.305
Don't think your sweet talk can fool me.

445
29:33.905 --> 29:37.705
If you truly meant to spare me, you wouldn't have walked in here

446
29:38.305 --> 29:40.145
trying to humiliate and threaten me.

447
29:41.425 --> 29:44.905
If I believed you and walked out of here.

448
29:46.265 --> 29:48.265
I'd be dead in the street by tomorrow.

449
29:50.625 --> 29:53.185
Weren't you going to expose me? Go ahead!

450
29:53.785 --> 29:55.625
Take it all the way to His Majesty if you want.

451
29:55.705 --> 29:57.625
All of you shall go down with me.

452
30:00.905 --> 30:02.305
Anything else to say, Brother Jue?

453
30:03.345 --> 30:04.425
If not,

454
30:05.945 --> 30:07.025
I'll be back to the banquet.

455
30:08.505 --> 30:09.345
Stop!

456
30:10.745 --> 30:13.145
You're the bravest woman I've ever met.

457
30:14.505 --> 30:17.305
There's nothing you won't dare think or do.

458
30:18.425 --> 30:20.585
If you're willing to risk everything,

459
30:21.705 --> 30:23.385
what can I possibly do to you?

460
30:24.225 --> 30:25.385
Stay a little longer.

461
30:26.265 --> 30:27.305
Let's talk this through.

462
30:53.345 --> 30:55.025
You knew I was a schemer and a hypocrite.

463
30:55.105 --> 30:57.265
You should've been more careful.

464
30:58.305 --> 30:59.225
Too bad.

465
31:04.345 --> 31:05.705
I gave you my word,

466
31:05.785 --> 31:07.265
and I never break it.

467
31:09.185 --> 31:11.545
Huo Jue, kill her.

468
31:16.545 --> 31:17.705
This isn't the place.

469
31:32.145 --> 31:34.185
Then I'll carve

470
31:35.985 --> 31:38.545
a dozen cuts into her face

471
31:39.225 --> 31:43.825
and see if she still dares impersonate me.

472
31:45.625 --> 31:46.985
Han Liao didn't deliberately cause trouble, did he?

473
31:47.065 --> 31:48.145
Give who trouble?

474
31:49.385 --> 31:50.505
Her Ladyship isn't at the banquet.

475
31:50.585 --> 31:52.065
Her maternal family, the Zhous, sent someone.

476
31:52.145 --> 31:55.305
But Lady Shou'an rarely has dealings with the capital's noble families.

477
31:55.385 --> 31:57.865
Yet she specifically asked her cousin to meet her in Jiangyun Hall.

478
31:59.225 --> 32:00.065
Cousin?

479
32:09.785 --> 32:12.305
My Lord, please wait. I need to speak with you.

480
32:15.025 --> 32:20.145
JIANGYUN HALL

481
32:24.745 --> 32:25.785
Hurry.

482
32:31.945 --> 32:33.745
I've always admired you

483
32:33.825 --> 32:36.225
as a man who knows right from wrong and puts justice above personal ties.

484
32:36.305 --> 32:39.665
But you know fully well that Wei Rao pushed me.

485
32:39.745 --> 32:41.225
Why are you covering for her?

486
32:41.305 --> 32:43.305
Just because she's your wife,

487
32:43.385 --> 32:45.585
she can ignore right and wrong and twist the truth?

488
32:45.665 --> 32:47.465
Do you know that at the banquet,

489
32:47.545 --> 32:49.545
if I hadn't spared the Duke's family

490
32:49.625 --> 32:51.505
and exposed her in front of everyone,

491
32:51.585 --> 32:54.825
her reputation would've been ruined across the capital.

492
32:58.145 --> 32:59.185
What are you laughing at?

493
32:59.265 --> 33:01.545
That day, aside from Xie and Wei family servants,

494
33:02.145 --> 33:03.705
there was no one else in the pavilion.

495
33:05.825 --> 33:07.305
That's why Old Madam Xie only dared to make veiled accusations.

496
33:08.185 --> 33:09.465
That's the real issue.

497
33:10.065 --> 33:11.785
So you weren't protecting the bigger picture.

498
33:11.865 --> 33:13.065
You were simply weighing the risks.

499
33:13.905 --> 33:16.785
Wei Rao is the Duke's new daughter-in-law.

500
33:16.865 --> 33:18.665
She is my lawful wife.

501
33:19.905 --> 33:21.625
Family comes before outsiders.

502
33:22.305 --> 33:23.785
Even if she has made mistakes,

503
33:24.385 --> 33:26.105
you shouldn't use them as an excuse to stop me,

504
33:26.705 --> 33:30.105
unless you meant to provoke Wei Rao into losing control in public

505
33:30.185 --> 33:31.305
and making even more mistakes.

506
33:32.225 --> 33:34.905
So you're saying I'm an outsider, with no right to question your wife

507
33:34.985 --> 33:37.185
or interfere in your marriage?

508
33:37.865 --> 33:41.385
If Wei Rao is wrong, I'll correct her and counsel her.

509
33:42.945 --> 33:44.265
You needn't concern yourself with her anymore.

510
33:48.865 --> 33:50.105
I was wrong about you.

511
34:00.145 --> 34:00.985
Let's go.

512
34:17.625 --> 34:18.784
Don't blame me.

513
34:18.865 --> 34:21.304
Once we make it safely through tonight, I'll hand her over to you.

514
34:21.905 --> 34:22.945
You can do whatever you want with her.

515
34:24.185 --> 34:27.344
I'll go to the banquet first. Rao, follow the plan.

516
34:27.865 --> 34:28.784
Understood.

517
34:29.505 --> 34:30.344
I'll go ahead.

518
34:30.425 --> 34:33.705
JIANGYUN HALL

519
34:50.385 --> 34:51.665
Dowager Lady has asked twice already.

520
34:51.744 --> 34:55.065
Go to Jiangyun Hall and tell Her Ladyship must return to the banquet at once.

521
34:55.145 --> 34:56.185
Yes.

522
35:00.505 --> 35:02.185
Come on, come on!

523
35:02.265 --> 35:03.385
Place your bets!

524
35:03.465 --> 35:04.385
-Come on! -Place your bets!

525
35:04.465 --> 35:05.345
-I'm betting odd! -Bet on what?

526
35:05.425 --> 35:07.145
-I'm betting even! -Odd or even?

527
35:07.225 --> 35:11.665
-Even! -Odd!

528
35:14.385 --> 35:15.585
-Again! -I'm betting even!

529
35:15.665 --> 35:17.425
-Odd! -I'm all in!

530
35:19.945 --> 35:21.305
My maternal grandmother went home for the ancestral rites

531
35:21.385 --> 35:23.145
and couldn't make it to the banquet.

532
35:23.225 --> 35:26.145
She asked me to bring a highly skilled Nuo opera troupe

533
35:26.785 --> 35:28.265
to offer the Duchess

534
35:28.345 --> 35:31.265
blessings, good fortune, and long life.

535
35:31.865 --> 35:32.785
Wonderful.

536
35:33.665 --> 35:35.665
Lady Xie, look!

537
35:35.745 --> 35:37.665
They're performing a Nuo dance for blessings.

538
36:01.625 --> 36:04.905
She never returned to the banquet. Where else could she have gone?

539
36:24.985 --> 36:25.825
What a beautiful dance.

540
37:26.825 --> 37:28.065
‎Her Ladyship!

541
37:29.145 --> 37:30.345
‎It is Her Ladyship.

542
37:30.425 --> 37:31.265
Rao!

543
37:34.225 --> 37:35.985
Bravo! Bravo!

544
37:36.065 --> 37:38.385
-Bravo! -Bravo!

545
37:40.465 --> 37:41.985
As your granddaughter-in-law, I offer this dance

546
37:42.065 --> 37:43.385
to honor you on your birthday.

547
37:43.465 --> 37:46.065
May Heaven bless you with joy, harmony, and good fortune.

548
37:46.945 --> 37:50.185
May you enjoy endless blessings, long life, and perfect health.

549
37:51.385 --> 37:52.585
-Wonderful! -It's Rao!

550
37:52.665 --> 37:54.105
Rao was the one dancing.

551
37:55.625 --> 37:57.625
She really put her heart into this.

552
37:58.625 --> 38:00.185
She even kept it a secret from all of us.

553
38:00.265 --> 38:02.025
With such striking makeup,

554
38:02.105 --> 38:03.585
she looks like a completely different person.

555
38:04.785 --> 38:06.425
No wonder her dance was beautiful,

556
38:06.505 --> 38:08.665
yet her movements looked different from everyone else's.

557
38:08.745 --> 38:10.105
So it was Rao!

558
38:15.785 --> 38:17.505
Then I'll carve

559
38:18.025 --> 38:19.505
a dozen cuts into her face

560
38:20.705 --> 38:24.585
and see if she still dares impersonate me.

561
38:30.305 --> 38:32.785
You can't kill her and stain Jiangyun Hall with blood.

562
38:32.865 --> 38:34.025
There will be no hiding from it.

563
38:35.025 --> 38:36.985
Your tempers and manners are completely different.

564
38:37.065 --> 38:38.265
Even if you change makeup and clothes,

565
38:38.345 --> 38:39.425
anyone paying attention will see through you.

566
38:40.385 --> 38:43.225
We need a way to distract everyone

567
38:43.305 --> 38:44.465
so no one has time to notice.

568
38:46.465 --> 38:48.945
Brother Jue, you really are a cunning merchant.

569
38:49.785 --> 38:51.105
You're incredibly devious.

570
38:52.745 --> 38:56.505
A cunning merchant will do anything to make sure you get what you want.

571
38:57.585 --> 39:00.785
After all, years ago, I gave your mother my word.

572
39:01.785 --> 39:04.625
At the banquet later, you must be extremely careful.

573
39:04.705 --> 39:05.905
Don't make a single mistake.

574
39:11.385 --> 39:13.025
Rao can do this too?

575
39:23.105 --> 39:26.265
Forgive me, Old Madam. I slipped.

576
39:26.345 --> 39:27.705
I'm afraid I've spoiled everyone's fun.

577
39:35.185 --> 39:36.345
They say

578
39:36.425 --> 39:38.305
Nuo dance can connect mortals with the divine.

579
39:38.385 --> 39:41.905
Yesterday, I was blessed to see the Queen Mother descend upon Penglai

580
39:41.985 --> 39:42.825
to hold a lotus feast.

581
39:43.425 --> 39:45.385
She took a sacred lotus from Mount Taihua's Jade Well.

582
39:46.465 --> 39:49.425
Its bloom spanned 100 feet, its root as large as a boat.

583
39:49.505 --> 39:51.545
It was cold as frost and sweeter than honey.

584
39:51.625 --> 39:54.025
They say Peng Zu ate just one slice of its root

585
39:54.105 --> 39:56.225
and lived for 800 years.

586
39:57.265 --> 39:59.865
So I quickly plucked one lotus petal

587
39:59.945 --> 40:02.145
and hid it in my robe.

588
40:02.225 --> 40:03.225
When I suddenly awoke,

589
40:04.025 --> 40:06.705
I was on a boat, drifting through a lotus pond.

590
40:07.305 --> 40:10.665
But in my hand, I was somehow clutching a lotus.

591
40:12.305 --> 40:14.465
Really? What happened next?

592
40:15.745 --> 40:16.985
This is that very lotus.

593
40:18.265 --> 40:21.505
The Queen Mother knew our Grandmother

594
40:21.585 --> 40:24.505
was kind, generous, and compassionate.

595
40:24.585 --> 40:26.945
So she bestowed this sacred lotus

596
40:27.465 --> 40:28.985
upon Grandmother

597
40:29.065 --> 40:31.905
to bless you with fortune, health, and a long life.

598
40:33.785 --> 40:35.665
Wonderful!

599
40:35.745 --> 40:37.385
-Well said! -Wonderful!

600
40:38.065 --> 40:39.905
-Indeed. -Wonderful!

601
40:41.225 --> 40:43.825
Rao, you really went all out

602
40:43.905 --> 40:46.585
to celebrate my birthday.

603
40:46.665 --> 40:49.105
-What a sweet girl. -Indeed.

604
40:49.185 --> 40:52.785
You've made this old woman truly delighted.

605
40:52.865 --> 40:53.865
Come.

606
40:56.545 --> 40:57.985
Come, everyone.

607
40:58.825 --> 41:01.705
Everyone, raise your cups.

608
41:01.785 --> 41:02.745
Let's celebrate this night together.

609
41:02.825 --> 41:03.905
Cheers.

610
41:03.985 --> 41:05.985
-Cheers. -Cheers.

611
41:20.705 --> 41:23.745
Lady Rao's Nuo dance was quite something, wasn't it?

612
41:25.545 --> 41:26.705
Where's Han Liao?

613
41:27.345 --> 41:28.185
Han Liao?

614
41:29.305 --> 41:31.505
Right. When did that man sneak away?

615
41:32.385 --> 41:33.585
I didn't even notice.

616
41:36.865 --> 41:38.705
Thank you, Brother Jue,

617
41:38.785 --> 41:40.065
for bringing the Nuo dance as a birthday gift

618
41:40.665 --> 41:42.785
and making me look so good.

619
41:42.865 --> 41:43.945
Unfortunately,

620
41:44.025 --> 41:45.425
-the Western Region incense you gave me -It's fascinating.

621
41:45.505 --> 41:46.625
-is far too strong and gaudy. -I'll show you again next time.

622
41:47.505 --> 41:49.105
It's not really to my taste.

623
41:51.265 --> 41:52.905
It's you.

624
41:54.185 --> 41:55.305
Impossible. You clearly…

625
41:56.665 --> 41:58.145
How could it be you?

626
42:01.225 --> 42:02.345
Lady Rao organized the birthday banquet,

627
42:02.425 --> 42:03.905
and someone's jealousy got the better of them.

628
42:03.985 --> 42:05.585
They locked her in a room in the east wing.

629
42:05.665 --> 42:08.985
My Lord isn't at the banquet. I'm afraid a fuss would cause gossip.

630
42:09.065 --> 42:10.905
I had no choice but to ask for your help.

631
42:11.745 --> 42:12.985
Get out!

632
42:24.905 --> 42:25.865
My Lady.

633
42:29.865 --> 42:30.905
General Qi…

634
42:38.465 --> 42:40.145
Then… Where's Jundai?

635
42:42.745 --> 42:44.905
I accidentally broke the Han family's gift.

636
42:44.985 --> 42:47.185
He had his men carry it back just as it was.

637
42:47.265 --> 42:51.545
Maybe he borrowed that large chest.

638
42:53.025 --> 42:55.065
-You wretched thing. -Lady Wei Rao.

639
42:55.145 --> 42:57.985
Wait here. Don't follow me.

640
43:02.625 --> 43:04.905
My Lady, they are the Han family's men.

641
43:04.985 --> 43:05.985
Understood.

642
43:06.065 --> 43:08.025
JIANGYUN HALL

643
43:24.345 --> 43:25.905
-Come on! Hurry! -I'm betting even again.

644
43:25.985 --> 43:27.345
Odd. I'm betting odd.

645
43:27.425 --> 43:28.625
-I'm betting odd. -Even!

646
43:28.705 --> 43:30.545
-Open it! -Even!

647
43:30.625 --> 43:31.665
-Even! -Odd!

648
43:50.585 --> 43:51.505
What a wonderful night.

649
44:05.905 --> 44:07.425
-What's wrong? -This is bad.

650
44:09.345 --> 44:12.385
My dear, your granddaughter

651
44:12.465 --> 44:15.425
is truly the finest young lady in the world.

652
44:15.505 --> 44:17.345
You raised her well.

653
44:17.425 --> 44:19.305
Come, let me toast you.

654
44:19.945 --> 44:21.545
After tonight,

655
44:21.625 --> 44:23.945
who in the capital won't know

656
44:24.025 --> 44:25.905
this wonderful young lady

657
44:25.985 --> 44:30.985
has just married into your Lu family?

658
44:32.945 --> 44:33.985
Come.

659
44:39.585 --> 44:42.025
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

660
44:42.105 --> 44:43.745
You don't need to see me any farther.

661
44:44.665 --> 44:47.825
My child, you did very well.

662
44:48.705 --> 44:51.145
No one could have done better.

663
44:51.745 --> 44:52.665
Go on back.

664
44:53.785 --> 44:54.985
Grandmother.

665
44:56.425 --> 44:59.265
I hear a distant cousin has come from our hometown

666
44:59.905 --> 45:02.465
who looks so much like me. It's hard to tell us apart.

667
45:03.065 --> 45:04.865
With her here to keep you company,

668
45:04.945 --> 45:06.745
I can leave with peace of mind.

669
45:07.265 --> 45:11.705
But she's unfamiliar with this place and can be rather impulsive.

670
45:12.225 --> 45:14.785
Please look after her

671
45:15.305 --> 45:18.625
and keep her from stumbling into trouble.

672
45:22.905 --> 45:23.905
Don't worry.

673
45:25.145 --> 45:26.025
Go on back.

674
45:37.505 --> 45:38.345
First Aunt.

675
45:42.145 --> 45:42.985
Take care.

676
45:56.905 --> 46:00.505
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

677
46:06.345 --> 46:07.385
Let's go back.

678
46:14.385 --> 46:16.225
I'll go get the medicine and be right back.

679
46:24.625 --> 46:25.665
Who are you, exactly?

680
48:52.425 --> 48:54.745
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
